#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:9
msgid "Static I/O resources and explicit data contracts"
msgstr "静态 I/O 资源与显式数据合同"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:11
msgid ""
"Extend an I/O mode without hidden execution, ambiguous units or a second "
"resource owner. Current MCU integration is the F4 package; exact supported "
"modes remain listed in [current support](../delivery/support.md). Public "
"generic mechanisms and host models do not grant another chip or hardware "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"扩展 I/O 模式时，不引入隐藏执行、含糊单位或第二个资源所有者。当前 MCU 集成是 F4 "
"包；精确支持的模式仍列于[当前支持](../delivery/support.md)。公共通用机制与主机模型不会赋予其他芯片或硬件模式支持。"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:16
msgid "Assembly and execution have different responsibilities"
msgstr "装配与执行承担不同责任"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:18
msgid ""
"![FIG-16: build-time plans and runtime calls have separate labeled "
"edges](../assets/diagrams/io-evolution.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-16：构建期计划与运行时调用采用分别标注的边](../assets/diagrams/io-evolution.svg)"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:18
msgid "FIG-16: build-time plans and runtime calls have separate labeled edges"
msgstr "FIG-16：构建期计划与运行时调用采用分别标注的边"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:20
msgid ""
"TOML selects reviewed modes and Board routes. The resolver checks fields, "
"capacities and conflicts, produces immutable typed IR and publishes one "
"atomic bundle. CMake remains the sole software target graph. Invalid input "
"neither selects a fallback mode nor leaves a usable partial configuration."
msgstr ""
"TOML 选择经过审阅的模式和 Board 路线。解析器检查字段、容量与冲突，产生不可变 typed IR，并发布一个原子 bundle。CMake "
"仍是唯一的软件目标图。无效输入既不会选择回退模式，也不会留下可用的部分配置。"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:25
msgid ""
"Factory lookup returns an existing static face; it does not allocate, read "
"silicon, initialize hardware or start tasks. Ordinary I/O dispatches through "
"shared readonly ops with the instance context. Applications own scheduling, "
"service progress and shutdown. Multiple faces do not create multiple owners "
"of the same physical controller."
msgstr ""
"Factory 查询返回已存在的静态接口面；它不分配内存、读取芯片、初始化硬件或启动任务。日常 I/O 通过共享只读 ops "
"和实例上下文分派。应用负责调度、服务推进与停机。多个接口面不会为同一物理控制器创建多个所有者。"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:31
msgid "Describe resources before generating instances"
msgstr "先描述资源，再生成实例"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:0
msgid "Plan"
msgstr "计划"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:0
msgid "Responsibility"
msgstr "责任"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:0
msgid "Boundary"
msgstr "边界"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:0
msgid "Resource graph"
msgstr "资源图"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:0
msgid "Physical aliases, personalities and hierarchical claims"
msgstr "物理别名、功能形态与分层资源声明"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:0
msgid "Separate pins do not authorize sharing a timer or controller"
msgstr "使用不同引脚不代表可以共享定时器或控制器"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:0
msgid "Trigger graph"
msgstr "触发图"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:0
msgid "Sources, routes, sinks and explicit stop owners"
msgstr "源、路线、接收端与显式停止责任者"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:0
msgid "A graph edge does not implement a trigger mode"
msgstr "一条图边不等于实现了触发模式"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:0
msgid "DMA topology"
msgstr "DMA 拓扑"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:0
msgid "Lanes, requests, reachable memory and exact descriptors"
msgstr "通道、请求、可达内存与精确描述符"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:0
msgid "A validated topology does not implement every DMA engine"
msgstr "拓扑通过验证不等于实现了所有 DMA 引擎"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:0
msgid "Timing"
msgstr "时序"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:0
msgid "Explicit clocks and electrical bounds"
msgstr "显式时钟与电气约束"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:0
msgid "A computed rate is not a measured physical waveform"
msgstr "计算得到的速率不等于测得的物理波形"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:40
msgid ""
"These are build-time proofs about supplied facts. Runtime hardware withdrawal"
" still requires the concrete C implementation. Clock, reset, shared filter "
"and timer-domain dependencies remain held until their users can actually "
"exit."
msgstr "这些是基于所提供事实的构建期证明。运行时退出硬件仍需要具体 C 实现。时钟、复位、共享过滤器及定时器域依赖，必须保留到其使用者确实可以退出。"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:44
msgid "Bind stream budgets to actual storage"
msgstr "将流预算绑定到实际存储"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:46
msgid ""
"Selected continuous UART and ADC profiles bind declared rates, service bounds"
" and exact pools. Hardware targets, replacement blocks and consumer retention"
" must fit actual capacity and integer ranges. These declarations are "
"assumptions, not measured latency or a lossless guarantee."
msgstr ""
"所选连续 UART 和 ADC "
"配置将声明速率、服务时限与精确池绑定。硬件目标、替换块及消费者保留量，必须符合实际容量与整数范围。这些声明是前提假设，不能作为实测延迟或无损保证。"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:51
msgid ""
"The application supplies all storage and joins pool users before "
"reconfiguration. A producer never overwrites READY or BORROWED blocks. If "
"replacement or service progress is insufficient it stops and reports loss. "
"Cancellation and timeout do not revoke a loan; failed drain preserves "
"quarantine and cleanup responsibility."
msgstr ""
"应用提供全部存储，并在重配置前等待所有池使用者退出。生产者不得覆盖 READY 或 BORROWED "
"块。替换块或服务推进不足时，应停止并报告丢失。取消与超时不会撤销借用；排空失败时继续保留隔离和清理责任。"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:56
msgid "Keep units and ownership explicit"
msgstr "显式表达单位与所有权"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:58
msgid ""
"UART uses bytes or the selected word format; ADC block counts use complete "
"scans; frames carry their reviewed layout and stride. Validate size "
"arithmetic, alignment and payload/control aliasing before retaining "
"references. DMA memory completion, peripheral wire completion and request "
"settlement are distinct."
msgstr ""
"UART 使用字节或所选字格式；ADC 块计数以完整扫描为单位；帧携带经审阅的布局与步长。保留引用前，应验证大小运算、对齐以及负载与控制数据的别名。DMA"
" 内存完成、外设线路完成与请求结清分别表示不同事实。"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:63
msgid ""
"Optional traits describe the selected implementation, not the chip's complete"
" marketing feature set. A controller, endpoint and companion interface retain"
" their own typed identities. Querying a capability does not prove "
"initialization, readiness, resource ownership or physical qualification."
msgstr ""
"可选 traits "
"描述所选实现，不代表芯片宣传资料中的全部特性。控制器、端点与伴随接口保留各自的类型化身份。能力查询不能证明初始化、就绪、资源所有权或物理资格。"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:68
msgid "Validate one selected implementation"
msgstr "验证一个所选实现"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:70
msgid ""
"Tests execute the production C with external hardware boundaries modeled. "
"Exercise rejection, cancellation, overflow, late events, actual withdrawal, "
"instance isolation and error recovery. ARM linking checks the selected ABI, "
"vectors and real memory layout; SDK checks independent consumption."
msgstr ""
"测试在建模外部硬件边界的同时执行生产 C。覆盖拒绝、取消、溢出、迟到事件、实际退出、实例隔离和错误恢复。ARM 链接检查所选 "
"ABI、向量和真实内存布局；SDK 检查独立消费。"

#: docs/design/io-evolution.md:75
msgid ""
"Measure resource changes under identical toolchain and configuration. "
"Physical IRQ latency, throughput, stack high-water and power require an "
"actual station. Unexecuted measurements stay unexecuted. The original cross-"
"family increments and ledgers retain their original evidence at [the fixed "
"prior source](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/design), without"
" becoming current F4 support claims."
msgstr ""
"在相同工具链和配置下测量资源变化。物理 IRQ "
"延迟、吞吐、栈高水位与功耗需要实际工位。未执行的测量保持未执行。原跨系列增量与台账在[固定旧源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/design)保留原始证据，不转化为当前"
" F4 支持声明。"
